00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.401 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You're very different
from Donald Trump.

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:05.138
I think one distinction you draw
is, again, you've even sai

00:00:05.138 --> 00:00:06.806 size:75% position:38%
